# The public hosts scripts/private_scan.py accepts (paddock#50). One per line: the
# host, then why it is here. An entry allows the host and every name under it, so
# list the narrowest one that is public and not ours; a host only one cluster knows
# never goes here (deploy/README.md, "Portable-base rules"). An entry no file uses
# fails the scan.

# Code, images and packages.
github.com                The organisation's code host: repositories, issues, releases, its API and docs, and noreply commit addresses.
raw.githubusercontent.com GitHub's raw files: the guard copy check fetches .github's agent/ from it.
nats-io.github.io         The NATS Helm chart's repository, which kustomize pulls the chart from.
ghcr.io                   GitHub's container registry, where the org's images are published.
docker.io                 Docker Hub, where the pinned NATS, nats-box and exporter images come from.
get.helm.sh               Helm's release downloads, which scripts/deploy_render.sh fetches pinned.
npmjs.com                 The npm registry, named in the contracts ADR.
golang.org                Go's module paths (golang.org/x/..., google.golang.org/protobuf), named in the ADRs and Go tooling.
buf.build                 Buf's registry and documentation, for the contracts tooling.
anthropic.com             The noreply address in the Co-Authored-By trailer of agent commits.

# Kubernetes and Argo CD API groups and label prefixes, which are names, not hosts.
k8s.io                    Kubernetes API groups (networking.k8s.io, kustomize.config.k8s.io).
kubernetes.io             Kubernetes' well-known labels (app.kubernetes.io) and its documentation.
argoproj.io               Argo CD's annotations (argocd.argoproj.io).

# Documentation and specifications cited by the docs and ADRs.
docs.nats.io              NATS's documentation.
argo-cd.readthedocs.io    Argo CD's documentation.
docs.renovatebot.com      Renovate's documentation, the schema renovate.json names.
json.schemastore.org      The JSON schema .claude/settings.json names.
duckdb.org                DuckDB's documentation, in the store ADRs.
cloudevents.io            The CloudEvents specification, in the contracts ADR.
connectrpc.com            Connect's documentation, in the contracts ADR.
protobuf.dev              Protocol Buffers' documentation, in the contracts ADR.
www.asyncapi.com          The AsyncAPI specification, in the contracts ADR.
go.dev                    Go's documentation, in the contracts tooling ADR.
slsa.dev                  The SLSA provenance specification, in the Fangio demo's record.
spdx.dev                  The SPDX SBOM specification, in the Fangio demo's record.
www.conventionalcommits.org The Conventional Commits specification AGENTS.md links.
www.gnu.org               The GPL's own text in LICENSE.
fsf.org                   The Free Software Foundation's address in LICENSE's text.
